## 7. Feature-Level Target State

The target state for Admin UX and developer experience is:

1. Data model changes:
   - No additional UXD-owned data model changes are required for current remediation.
   - Future enterprise user and role assignment workflows require AUTH/IdP-owned schema and API decisions.
